	(text "1  POWER\nUSB-C sink (5.1k on each CC), ESD on D+/D-.\n0 ohm links R12/R13: remove for power-only USB.\nAMS1117-3.3 (1 A). No battery."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "001d39ab-a0ec-58d3-a526-fbbed30e2bb7")
	)
	(text "2  MCU: ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N8R2 (back face, by hand)\nProfile picoquorum-key (docs/PINS.md). IO0 pulled up, BOOT only.\nIO3, IO45, IO46 (straps) and IO35-37 unconnected. EN: 10k + 1u."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 165.1 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e8ac291d-9f3d-5f4c-81d6-8c88460e5311")
	)
	(text "3  DISPLAY: ST7789 240x135, 8-pin 0.5 mm ZIF\nPanel ER-TFT1.14-2, pins from 1: LEDA GND RESET RS SDA SCL VDD CS.\nRibbon folds under the glass: panel pin n on J2 pad 9-n.\nBacklight from 5 V: off at reset, on when IO21 is high."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 292.1 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "18bb9211-f34f-5e7d-8684-10db6dc33aee")
	)
	(text "4  BUTTONS AND LED\nAll buttons to GND; firmware enables the S3's pull-ups. Pressed reads 0.\nD0/D1/D2 sit level with screen rows 7/67/127."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 165.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "88196d1c-3cc1-5fa2-955c-8b1bded9689a")
	)
	(text "5  THE KEY: ATECC608C-MAHDA at 0x60\nNothing else on the bus. Placed by JLCPCB.\nBus also on pads TP6/TP7 for a key on wires."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 165.1 165.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ba7c616d-b608-5166-af26-80d892fc5db0")
	)
	(text "6  DEBUG PADS (back face) AND MOUNTING HOLES\nTP: 3V3 GND EN TX RX SDA SCL BOOT KCC KEN 5V GND KSDA KSCL"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 292.1 165.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d70edb44-8793-5201-80b8-93c697e79d36")
	)
	(text "7  THE KEY PORT (rev B): a key-c on its own bus, I2C(1)\nFit 'port' only, but R17 (every board). Power off at reset: R15 holds U5's EN low.\nSDA on D+ (A6), SCL on D- (A7), VKEY on VBUS, one CC line (A5), SBU (A8+B8) from VKEY.\nESD rails on 3V3, never VKEY. J3 hand-fitted; 0.8 mm board."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 266.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f8c085f2-5a06-5c7e-968c-75f0a7c219b2")
	)
